{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"verdan_arrival","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_arrival/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_verdan_gate.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Verdan. The largest settlement in the Gray Belt.","text_ko":"베르단. 그레이 벨트에서 가장 큰 정착지."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_arrival/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The stench hit first, burnt spice and animal fat, vendor fires sending up columns of greasy smoke that never quite cleared.","text_ko":"악취가 먼저 닿았다, 탄 향신료와 짐승 기름. 노점의 불들이 걷힐 줄 모르는 기름진 연기 기둥을 밀어 올리고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_arrival/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Arrel pulled his scarf higher. Elia did the same, though hers covered something more than anonymity.","text_ko":"아렐이 목도리를 끌어올렸다. 엘리아도 따라 했다. 다만 그녀의 것은 익명 이상의 것을 가리고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_arrival/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"The Sump. Underground. Follow me.","text_ko":"더 섬프. 지하야. 따라와."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_arrival/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":0,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"She moved through the crowd like water through cracks, never touching, never stopping, always finding the gap.","text_ko":"그녀는 갈라진 틈을 지나는 물처럼 군중을 통과했다, 스치지 않고, 멈추지 않고, 언제나 틈을 찾아내면서."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"18f3943353502cec8beb14e7271cf4f08c612d9b158a424847a62d8f2ae8edd8","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9